acceptance_criteria: The script shards are disjoint and cover the entire existing script file population; no guarded native command is removed; worker and timeout caps are retained; existing workflow contract checks and actual hosted Windows acceptance pass for both scripts shards plus native cohort; final main CI is green.
parent: pm-bj7rq0
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
resolution: "Use two deterministic scripts shards and one intact native cohort, preserving maxWorkers2, max-parallel2, the12-minute job cap and the required aggregate that rejects non-success outcomes."
expected_result: "Every script file and native guard remains admitted, each Windows cohort finishes under the unchanged cap and no failed canceled skipped or absent result can be accepted."
actual_result: The guard fails before repair; all21 workflow contract tests and both linked checks pass. Actual Vitest partitions104 files into complete disjoint52/52 sets. Hosted scripts cohorts pass in383s/294s and native in417s; required aggregate and complete CI39479180880 pass with10852 tests and exact100/100/100/100 coverage. Historical canceled-attempt evidence is preserved.
